## ⚡ PERFORMANCE
### Targets
| Operation | Target | Current |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| Mostrar ocupación (NF02) | < 3 s, datos < 60 s | — |

### Rules
- No N+1 queries. Use joins or eager loading. Check query count before shipping.
- Paginate all list endpoints. No unbounded queries.
- No blocking scripts in `<head>`. Use `defer` or `async`.

